text: "# Implementation Plan: [Project Name]\n\n> Auto-generated by Aegis — Gate 3: PLAN\n> Track progress: `- [ ]` → `- [x]`\n\n## Status\n- **Gate**: 4 — IMPLEMENT\n- **Progress**: 0 / 0 tasks complete\n- **Last Updated**: [timestamp]\n\n---\n\n## Task 1: [Title]\n**Priority**: P0 (Must Have)\n**Files**: `path/to/file`, `path/to/test`\n**Depends On**: None\n\n- [ ] Step 1: Write failing test for [feature]\n- [ ] Step 2: Implement minimal code to pass test\n- [ ] Step 3: Verify test passes\n- [ ] Step 4: Refactor if needed\n\n---\n\n## Task 2: [Title]\n**Priority**: P0 (Must Have)\n**Files**: `path/to/file`, `path/to/test`\n**Depends On**: Task 1\n\n- [ ] Step 1: ...\n- [ ] Step 2: ...\n\n---\n\n<!-- Add more tasks as needed -->\n<!-- Each task should modify 1-3 files max -->\n<!-- Steps should follow TDD: test → implement → verify -->\n"
